[12:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'out and they made it stronger. But please check out the full reviews before purchasing so you know what you\'re getting yourselves in for. Have you been waiting for the P1 Max? Are you happy it\'s finally arrived? What are you eager'

[13:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
